{"seq":5,"slug":"on-protracted-war","title":"《论持久战》精读","stage":"DONE","category":"mao-zedong-studies","categoryLabel":"毛泽东研究","chapterCount":4,"docCount":10,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-protracted-war","rating":{"composite":3.69,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.33,"strategic":3.5},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.1,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/leaders/01_mao-zedong-studies/05_on-protracted-war","introMarkdown":"# 《论持久战》精读 简介\n\n《论持久战》是毛泽东于一九三八年五月至六月在延安抗日战争研究会上的演讲，是指导中国抗日战争全局的纲领性军事政治著作。全文在客观分析中日双方基本特点的基础上，科学预见了抗日战争的持久性质和最终胜利的必然结局，系统提出了战略防御、战略相持、战略反攻三个阶段的战争进程论断，并就具体的战争方法论展开了深刻论述。\n\n本知识库适用于希望深入研读毛泽东军事战略思想的读者，无论是军事理论研究者、历史学习者，还是对战略分析方法和持久战思想感兴趣的一般读者，都能从本书的精读中获得系统的战略思维训练。\n\n第一章**战略形势与基本判断**，从抗战初期\"亡国论\"与\"速胜论\"两种错误论调的批判出发，系统分析中日双方在军力、经济力、政治组织力和战争性质等方面的四个基本特点，进而论证持久战的战略总方针及其必然走向最终胜利的客观依据。\n\n第二章**三阶段论与战争进程**，深入阐述毛泽东对抗日战争将经历战略防御、战略相持和战略反攻三个阶段的科学预见，分析每一阶段中敌我力量对比的变化趋势、战争形态的演变特征以及战略任务的具体内容。\n\n第三章**战争方法论**，从主动性、灵活性、计划性三个基本范畴出发，阐述抗日战争中的作战指导原则，并深入分析运动战、游击战、阵地战三种基本作战形式的辩证关系及其在不同阶段的战略地位。\n\n第四章**历史验证与战略遗产**，将毛泽东的理论预见与抗日战争的实际进程进行对照验证，分析三阶段论在历史中的实现程度，并探讨持久战思想超越具体战争语境的普遍战略价值及其对当代战略研究的启示意义。\n\n推荐学习路径为：先通过第一章建立对战争全局形势的客观认知，理解持久战判断的逻辑基础；再在第二章中把握战争进程的阶段性规律；接着在第三章中掌握具体的作战指导方法论；最后在第四章中通过历史验证深化对理论预见力的认识，完成从战略判断到方法论再到历史检验的完整学习闭环。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"strategic-situation-judgment","title":"战略形势与基本判断","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-protracted-war/strategic-situation-judgment","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"context-defeatism-vs-quick-victory","title":"写作背景：亡国论与速胜论","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-protracted-war/strategic-situation-judgment/context-defeatism-vs-quick-victory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"four-characteristics-sino-japanese-war","title":"中日战争的四个基本特点","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-protracted-war/strategic-situation-judgment/four-characteristics-sino-japanese-war"},{"seq":3,"slug":"protracted-war-grand-strategy","title":"持久战的战略总方针","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-protracted-war/strategic-situation-judgment/protracted-war-grand-strategy"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"three-stages-theory","title":"三阶段论与战争进程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-protracted-war/three-stages-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"strategic-defense-stage","title":"战略防御阶段","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-protracted-war/three-stages-theory/strategic-defense-stage"},{"seq":2,"slug":"strategic-stalemate-stage","title":"战略相持阶段","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-protracted-war/three-stages-theory/strategic-stalemate-stage"},{"seq":3,"slug":"strategic-counteroffensive-stage","title":"战略反攻阶段","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-protracted-war/three-stages-theory/strategic-counteroffensive-stage"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"war-methodology","title":"战争方法论","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-protracted-war/war-methodology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"initiative-flexibility-planning","title":"主动性、灵活性、计划性","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-protracted-war/war-methodology/initiative-flexibility-planning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mobile-guerrilla-positional-warfare","title":"运动战、游击战与阵地战","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-protracted-war/war-methodology/mobile-guerrilla-positional-warfare"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"historical-validation-legacy","title":"历史验证与战略遗产","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-protracted-war/historical-validation-legacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"historical-validation","title":"持久战预见的历史对照","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-protracted-war/historical-validation-legacy/historical-validation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"contemporary-strategic-value","title":"持久战思想的当代战略价值","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/mao-zedong-studies/on-protracted-war/historical-validation-legacy/contemporary-strategic-value"}]}]}